<%#
# Sidebar group

A captioned block of sidebar entries.

## Local variables:

- `id`: DOM id of the caption (labels the group).
- `title`: caption text, rendered uppercase by CSS.

Render with a block: `render layout: 'nav_group', locals: { id:, title: } do ... end`.
%>
<div role="group" aria-labelledby="<%= id %>" class="flex flex-col gap-0.5 pb-1 pt-2">
  <span id="<%= id %>" class="px-2 pb-1 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-n-slate-10"><%= title %></span>
  <%= yield %>
</div>
